<Folder><name>1 - Source &amp; pre-collapse movement</name>
<Placemark><name>USGS collapse source</name><styleUrl>#src</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<p>Collapse source / seismic reference. Nature later reported pre-collapse acceleration near the failure zone.</p><p><b>Sources / visuals:</b><br><a href="https://earthquake.usgs.gov/earthquakes/eventpage/us7000tbwb/executive">https://earthquake.usgs.gov/earthquakes/eventpage/us7000tbwb/executive</a><br><a href="https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-02746-4">https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-02746-4</a><br></p>]]></description><Point><coordinates>85.515,28.271,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>Pre-collapse acceleration observation zone</name><styleUrl>#move</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<p>Sentinel-1 analysis reported by Nature found downhill motion and acceleration of the glacier-rock system before Aug. 26; final observation about a week before collapse.</p><p><b>Sources / visuals:</b><br><a href="https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-02746-4">https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-02746-4</a><br></p>]]></description><Point><coordinates>85.515,28.271,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
</Folder>
<Folder><name>2 - 10-mile investigation radius</name><Placemark><name>10-mile radius from USGS source</name><styleUrl>#radius</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<p>Approximate 10-mile / 16.1-km search radius used for Nepal/China infrastructure sweep. Not a hazard boundary.</p><p><b>Sources / visuals:</b><br><a href="https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-02746-4">https://www.nature.com/articles/d41586-026-02746-4</a><br></p>]]></description><Polygon><outerBoundaryIs><LinearRing><coordinates>85.515,28.415568810636007,0 85.52930652437936,28.415018682665018,0 85.54350416746968,28.413372485558092,0 85.55748487663426,28.41064274786921,0 85.5711422502346,28.406850244550448,0 85.58437234741102,28.402023838842037,0 85.59707447913549,28.39620026260568,0 85.6091519745158,28.389423836772913,0 85.62051291651953,28.38174613403603,0 85.63107084151811,28.373225586348795,0 85.64074539732725,28.363927040223945,0 85.64946295473557,28.353921263212108,0 85.65715716786741,28.343284405318002,0 85.66376947911493,28.33209741945291,0 85.66924956479693,28.320445445334148,0 85.67355571815237,28.308417161520417,0 85.67665516675413,28.296104110514417,0 85.67852432192683,28.28360000206913,0 85.67914895827097,28.271,0 85.67852432192683,28.258399997930873,0 85.67665516675413,28.245895889485585,0 85.67355571815237,28.233582838479585,0 85.66924956479693,28.221554554665854,0 85.66376947911493,28.20990258054709,0 85.65715716786741,28.198715594682,0 85.64946295473557,28.188078736787894,0 85.64074539732725,28.178072959776056,0 85.63107084151811,28.168774413651207,0 85.62051291651953,28.16025386596397,0 85.6091519745158,28.15257616322709,0 85.59707447913549,28.14579973739432,0 85.58437234741102,28.139976161157964,0 85.5711422502346,28.135149755449554,0 85.55748487663426,28.13135725213079,0 85.54350416746968,28.12862751444191,0 85.52930652437936,28.126981317334984,0 85.515,28.126431189363995,0 85.50069347562064,28.126981317334984,0 85.48649583253032,28.12862751444191,0 85.47251512336574,28.13135725213079