<Folder><name>3 - China/Tibet &amp; border infrastructure</name>
<Placemark><name>Gyirong Port of Entry (China/Tibet)</name><styleUrl>#china</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<p>Confirmed Chinese border infrastructure opposite Rasuwagadhi; connected to G216. Existing infrastructure, not a verified blast site.</p><p><b>Sources / visuals:</b><br><a href="https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q132573083">https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q132573083</a><br><a href="https://www.reuters.com/world/china/china-restores-road-access-tibet-disaster-zone-search-intensifies-2026-09-02/">https://www.reuters.com/world/china/china-restores-road-access-tibet-disaster-zone-search-intensifies-2026-09-02/</a><br></p>]]></description><Point><coordinates>85.37778,28.27972,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>G216 corridor near Gyirong Port (schematic reference)</name><styleUrl>#china</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<p>Confirmed G216 highway corridor serving Gyirong Port. Marker is a schematic road-corridor reference, not a construction or blasting coordinate.</p><p><b>Sources / visuals:</b><br><a href="https://www.reuters.com/world/china/china-restores-road-access-tibet-disaster-zone-search-intensifies-2026-09-02/">https://www.reuters.com/world/china/china-restores-road-access-tibet-disaster-zone-search-intensifies-2026-09-02/</a><br><a href="https://www.reuters.com/business/environment/chinese-rescue-work-tibet-flood-disaster-zone-still-trudging-along-days-later-2026-09-01/">https://www.reuters.com/business/environment/chinese-rescue-work-tibet-flood-disaster-zone-still-trudging-along-days-later-2026-09-01/</a><br></p>]]></description><Point><coordinates>85.39,28.3,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>Timure / Rasuwagadhi dry-port area</name><styleUrl>#china</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<p>Chinese-financed dry-port / customs infrastructure on Nepal side. July 18 reporting said construction remained stalled after prior flood damage.</p><p><b>Sources / visuals:</b><br><a href="https://english.khabarhub.com/2026/18/559159/">https://english.khabarhub.com/2026/18/559159/</a><br><a href="https://english.nepalnews.com/s/gallery/rasuwagadhi-dry-port-stalled-as-timure-customs-operates-amid-flood-ruins-photo-feature/">https://english.nepalnews.com/s/gallery/rasuwagadhi-dry-port-stalled-as-timure-customs-operates-amid-flood-ruins-photo-feature/</a><br></p>]]></description><Point><coordinates>85.36667,28.25285,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
</Folder>
<Folder><name>4 - Hydropower / project reference points</name>
<Placemark><name>Rasuwagadhi Hydropower Project reference</name><styleUrl>#proj</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<p>111 MW hydropower reference point with major underground works. Project reference, not blast coordinate. Straight-line distance from USGS source: 14.4 km (8.9 mi).</p><p><b>Sources / visuals:</b><br><a href="https://hydro.naxa.com.np/core/datasets/">https://hydro.naxa.com.np/core/datasets/</a><br></p>]]></description><Point><coordinates>85.37013889,28.25111111,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>Distance: source → Rasuwagadhi Hydropower Project reference (14.4 km / 8.9 mi)</name><styleUrl>#dist</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<p>Straight-line project-reference distance only. Not a blast propagation path or tunnel connection.</p><p><b>Sources / visuals:</b><br><a href="https://hydro.naxa.com.np/core/datasets/">https://hydro.naxa.com.np/core/datasets/</a><br></p>]]></description><LineString><tessellate>1</tessellate><coordinates>85.515,28.271,0 85.37013889,28.25111111,0</coordinates></LineString></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>Langtang Khola Small Hydropower licensed-area midpoint</name><styleUrl>#proj</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<p>Approximate licensed-area midpoint. Major underground works documented; not a verified blast coordinate. Straight-line distance from USGS source: 20.0 km (12.4 mi).</p><p><b>Sources / visuals:</b><br><a href="https://doed.gov.np/pages/clhydromorethan1/">https://doed.gov.np/pages/clhydromorethan1/</a><br></p>]]></description><Point><coordinates>85.3568,28.1575,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>Distance: source → Langtang Khola Small Hydropower licensed-area midpoint (20.0 km / 12.4 mi)</name><styleUrl>#dist</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<p>Straight-line project-reference distance only. Not a blast propagation path or tunnel connection.</p><p><b>Sources / visuals:</b><br><a href="https://doed.gov.np/pages/clhydromorethan1/">https://doed.gov.np/pages/clhydromorethan1/</a><br></p>]]></description><LineString><tessellate>1</tessellate><coordinates>85.515,28.271,0 85.3568,28.1575,0</coordinates></LineString></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>Upper Trishuli-1 dam published reference</name><styleUrl>#proj</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<p>216 MW project. IFC documents significant blasting for tunnels, underground facilities and access road. Dam reference is not a blast coordinate. Straight-line distance from USGS source: 26.6 km (16.6 mi).</p><p><b>Sources / visuals:</b><br><a href="https://disclosures.ifc.org/project-detail/ESRS/35701/upper-trishuli-1">https://disclosures.ifc.org/project-detail/ESRS/35701/upper-trishuli-1</a><br><a href="https://nwedcpl.com/project/upper-trishuli-1-hep-216-mw/">https://nwedcpl.com/project/upper-trishuli-1-hep-216-mw/</a><br></p>]]></description><Point><coordinates>85.297894,28.126836,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>Distance: source → Upper Trishuli-1 dam published reference (26.6 km / 16.6 mi)</name><styleUrl>#dist</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<p>Straight-line project-reference distance only. Not a blast propagation path or tunnel connection.</p><p><b>Sources / visuals:</b><br><a href="https://disclosures.ifc.org/project-detail/ESRS/35701/upper-trishuli-1">https://disclosures.ifc.org/project-detail/ESRS/35701/upper-trishuli-1</a><br><a href="https://nwedcpl.com/project/upper-trishuli-1-hep-216-mw/">https://nwedcpl.com/project/upper-trishuli-1-hep-216-mw/</a><br></p>]]></description><LineString><tessellate>1</tessellate><coordinates>85.515,28.271,0 85.297894,28.126836,0</coordinates></LineString></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>Mathillo Langtang historical survey-area midpoint</name><styleUrl>#proj</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<p>Historical survey-license footprint discussed in investigation. Does not establish active construction or blasting in Aug. 2026. Straight-line distance from USGS source: 7.3 km (4.5 mi).</p><p><b>Sources / visuals:</b><br><a href="https://doed.gov.np/pages/hydromorethan1/">https://doed.gov.np/pages/hydromorethan1/</a><br></p>]]></description><Point><coordinates>85.536389,28.208194,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>Distance: source → Mathillo Langtang historical survey-area midpoint (7.3 km / 4.5 mi)</name><styleUrl>#dist</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<p>Straight-line project-reference distance only. Not a blast propagation path or tunnel connection.</p><p><b>Sources / visuals:</b><br><a href="https://doed.gov.np/pages/hydromorethan1/">https://doed.gov.np/pages/hydromorethan1/</a><br></p>]]></description><LineString><tessellate>1</tessellate><coordinates>85.515,28.271,0 85.536389,28.208194,0</coordinates></LineString></Placemark>
</Folder>
<Folder><name>5 - Flood corridor &amp; direction</name>
<Placemark><name>Rasuwagadhi border corridor</name><styleUrl>#flood</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<p>Border corridor struck by debris/flood.</p><p><b>Sources / visuals:</b><br><a href="https://rasuwaflood.org/">https://rasuwaflood.org/</a><br></p>]]></description><Point><coordinates>85.3773,28.2751,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>Syabrubesi</name><styleUrl>#flood</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<p>Flood-affected upstream settlement.</p><p><b>Sources / visuals:</b><br><a href="https://www.reuters.com/business/environment/flood-ravaged-nepal-valley-nothing-is-left-standing-2026-09-03/">https://www.reuters.com/business/environment/flood-ravaged-nepal-valley-nothing-is-left-standing-2026-09-03/</a><br></p>]]></description><Point><coordinates>85.33784,28.16282,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>Mailung</name><styleUrl>#flood</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<p>Flood/hydropower corridor location.</p><p><b>Sources / visuals:</b><br><a href="https://www.reuters.com/world/asia-pacific/nepal-hydropower-sites-centre-flood-rescue-efforts-2026-08-31/">https://www.reuters.com/world/asia-pacific/nepal-hydropower-sites-centre-flood-rescue-efforts-2026-08-31/</a><br></p>]]></description><Point><coordinates>85.207,28.07177,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>Betrawati</name><styleUrl>#flood</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<p>Downstream flood-affected settlement.</p><p><b>Sources / visuals:</b><br><a href="https://www.reuters.com/world/china/chinese-national-rescued-nepal-tunnel-day-after-2-nepalis-pulled-out-alive-2026-09-05/">https://www.reuters.com/world/china/chinese-national-rescued-nepal-tunnel-day-after-2-nepalis-pulled-out-alive-2026-09-05/</a><br></p>]]></description><Point><coordinates>85.18595,27.97311,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>Trishuli Bazar</name><styleUrl>#flood</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<p>Major downstream Trishuli corridor settlement.</p><p><b>Sources / visuals:</b><br><a href="https://www.reuters.com/pictures/nepal-heartbreaking-scenes-after-deadly-flash-floods-2026-08-31/">https://www.reuters.com/pictures/nepal-heartbreaking-scenes-after-deadly-flash-floods-2026-08-31/</a><br></p>]]></description><Point><coordinates>85.14899,27.92255,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>Galchhi</name><styleUrl>#flood</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<p>Downstream reference; scientific reconstruction reported dramatic river rise.</p><p><b>Sources / visuals:</b><br><a href="https://storymaps.arcgis.com/stories/f2b2425eac544929a7d18f4c90b41d66">https://storymaps.arcgis.com/stories/f2b2425eac544929a7d18f4c90b41d66</a><br></p>]]></description><Point><coordinates>85.00046,27.7974,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>Devghat</name><styleUrl>#flood</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<p>Far-downstream recovery area; recovery location is not necessarily death location.</p><p><b>Sources / visuals:</b><br><a href="https://www.reuters.com/business/environment/nepal-begins-mass-burials-unidentified-flood-victims-families-seek-missing-2026-08-30/">https://www.reuters.com/business/environment/nepal-begins-mass-burials-unidentified-flood-victims-families-seek-missing-2026-08-30/</a><br></p>]]></description><Point><coordinates>84.42647,27.74563,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark>
<Placemark><name>Flood-flow direction corridor (schematic centerline)</name><styleUrl>#flowline</styleUrl><description><![CDATA[<p>Schematic centerline through sourced downstream reference points. Use USGS/Rasuwa maps for authoritative flood extent.</p><p><b>Sources / visuals:</b><br><a href="https://www.usgs.gov/media/images/2026-nepal-debris-avalanche-and-flash-flood-map">https://www.usgs.gov/media/images/2026-nepal-debris-avalanche-and-flash-flood-map</a><br><a href="https://rasuwaflood.org/">https://rasuwaflood.org/</a><br></p>]]></description><LineString><tessellate>1</tessellate><coordinates>85.3773,28.2751,0 85.33784,28.16282,0 85.207,28.07177,0 85.18595,27.97311,0 85.14899,27.92255,0 85.00046,27.7974,0 84.42647,27.74563,0</coordinates></LineString></Placemark>
